  "sourceTitle": "Fluffy Bread Pudding",
  "sourceText": "Fluffy Bread Pudding\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Wednesday, December 30, 2009 - 12:22am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n3 cups white bread crumbs\n1 cup sugar\n1/4 teaspoon salt\n1 teaspoon nutmeg or 2 tbsp. cocoa\n2 eggs, beaten\n1/2 cup raisins\n2 cups milk\n1 tablespoon butter\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine bread, sugar, nutmeg, salt and raisins, beat milk, butter, stir into bread mixture, stir in lightly beaten eggs. Pour into greased dish and bake at 325 degrees for 45 minutes.",
